  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae309fc9b93c4434b888290b1d747f9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 410270348}
  teacherName: Bucko
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 1256853252}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1682790333}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  battleCanvas: {fileID: 782108657}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Good morning.
  - Are you here for the deep-reaching magic of plants?
  - "Listen well, magic leaves traces. You can use your own magic to search for the
    signs of it\u2014plant magic is especially good for this."
  - "Active enchantments and past spells can be seen\u2026or rather\u2026felt through
    plant magic, deep in the roots."
  - "Try it with this first assignment! Dodge this tree\u2019s roots!"
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - Well done, charName!
  - "I personally have a great fondness for plant magic, both for how this form contains
    stories, like a tree\u2019s rings and the sense of peace I find, even in the
    heat of battle."
  - "Let us duel. Take a breath and show me what you\u2019ve learned!"
  afterBattleLines:
  - Did you feel it? The growth of your courage and the deepening of your wisdom?
  - Stay curious, young sapling! Take this spell as a token of your progress as a
    magician.
  afterSpellLines:
  - Stay curious, young sapling! Know that you have a village supporting you.
